title: "DentCAM-RCNN: Mathematical Analysis of Convolutional Neural Networks and Explainable Instance Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Repository accompanying a joint Bachelor's Thesis in Computer Science and
  Engineering and Mathematics, combining a mathematical analysis of
  convolutional neural networks with Mask R-CNN instance segmentation of
  dental radiographs and Grad-CAM explainability.
